# SUPERSEDES the 2026-09-11 release-based shadow draft (commit 884cbfb): the
# H1-2026 6-K LANDED 2026-09-17 and every figure below is now sourced from the
# STATUTORY INTERIM STATEMENTS, not the earnings release.
#
# PRIMARY SOURCE: TEN H1-2026 interim financial statements, Form 6-K, EDGAR
# accession 0001193125-26-394366, filed 2026-09-17, period ended 2026-06-30
# (unaudited). Staged: inputs/filings/TEN/0001193125-26-394366_6-K_d67788d6k.htm.
# READING MECHANICS (the FRO precedent of 2026-09-17): the staged document is a
# 1.3MB single-file inline-XBRL exhibit whose body is one ~94k-token line and is
# UNREADABLE by the Read tool, so every figure below was read from the EDGAR
# R-renderings of THIS accession, fetched 2026-09-18:
