# Secondary (comparatives / prior convention only): Q1-2026 6-K ex 99.1 (acc
# 0001193125-26-236934, filed 2026-05-22); FY2025 20-F (acc 0001193125-26-144027,
# filed 2026-04-06); H1/Q2-2026 results release (GlobeNewswire 3359616,
